    "disclosures": [
      {
        "id": "d_01",
        "from": 2,
        "to": 2,
        "text": "本书出场角色均已满18岁，不存在任何未成年人。",
        "channel": "author",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d_02",
        "from": 6,
        "to": 6,
        "text": "吐掉牙膏泡沫后，苏天晴放下猫猫水杯与牙刷，双手撑住洗手池，抬头看向镜子里的金毛狐狐。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su_current",
          "r_fox_body"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_03",
        "from": 7,
        "to": 7,
        "text": "镜中的金毛狐狐五官无可挑剔，精致可爱，毛发柔顺肌肤光滑，能从宽松睡衣领口瞥见浅浅河谷，眼眸不安中带惊讶，仿佛有狐人生来便有的魅意。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_fox_body"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_04",
        "from": 8,
        "to": 8,
        "text": "苏天晴认为抛开离谱的反派魔法少女不谈，这副身体的模样绝妙中的绝妙。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_villain_role",
          "r_fox_body"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_05",
        "from": 12,
        "to": 12,
        "text": "苏天晴觉得美妙，自己真是太可爱了。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_fox_body"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_06",
        "from": 13,
        "to": 14,
        "text": "苏天晴认为面庞和身材都与自己曾经想象中的完美匹配，萝莉本身就是最美妙的奖励。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_fox_body"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_07",
        "from": 17,
        "to": 17,
        "text": "苏天晴意识到自己舔镜的举动很像变态，微红脸收敛，开始认真审视身体中残留的记忆。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su_current",
          "r_fox_body"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_08",
        "from": 18,
        "to": 18,
        "text": "这副身体的原主人叫苏天晴；这里与苏天晴曾经的世界相差无几，但人类与兽人共存。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su_original",
          "r_beastkin"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_09",
        "from": 19,
        "to": 19,
        "text": "这里的兽人指猫娘狐娘，不是从地里长出来的大菌子绿皮。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_beastkin"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_10",
        "from": 20,
        "to": 20,
        "text": "兽人数量远不及人类；原主人苏天晴从小孤独长大，社恐孤僻，受兽人互助协会资助考上蓉城最好的医学院，临近开学染上兽人流感，熬夜中突发暴发性心肌炎。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su_original",
          "r_beastkin",
          "r_rongcheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_11",
        "from": 21,
        "to": 21,
        "text": "苏天晴心想原主人的死法和自己一模一样。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_su_original"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_12",
        "from": 26,
        "to": 26,
        "text": "苏天晴问古书：小破书你在吗？",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_ancient_book"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_13",
        "from": 27,
        "to": 28,
        "text": "古书沉默，没有像刚才那样开口说话。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_ancient_book"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_14",
        "from": 29,
        "to": 29,
        "text": "苏天晴猜测所谓的反派魔法少女可能根本不存在。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "conjecture",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_villain_role"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_15",
        "from": 30,
        "to": 33,
        "text": "苏天晴翻开古书扉页，一枚金色十字星从书里掉出，砸在毫无防备的苏天晴脸上。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su_current",
          "r_ancient_book",
          "r_guardian_star"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_16",
        "from": 35,
        "to": 35,
        "text": "苏天晴喊疼，发现鼻血冒出来。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d_17",
        "from": 36,
        "to": 36,
        "text": "金毛狐狐怪叫着抓纸巾，没注意到金色十字星上的鼻血在微光后融入十字星中消失。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_fox_body",
          "r_guardian_star"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_18",
        "from": 37,
        "to": 39,
        "text": "陌生声音在狐狐脑中响起，宣布守护之星激活，秘典序章已完成，开启每日任务。",
        "channel": "in-world-system",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_system_voice",
        "about": [
          "r_guardian_star",
          "r_daily_task",
          "r_ancient_book"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_19",
        "from": 40,
        "to": 40,
        "text": "苏天晴惊讶每日任务与守护之星竟然是真的。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_daily_task",
          "r_guardian_star"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_20",
        "from": 41,
        "to": 41,
        "text": "狐狐愣了一下，回头看向发微光的金色十字星，把它重新拿在手里。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_fox_body",
          "r_guardian_star"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_21",
        "from": 42,
        "to": 42,
        "text": "苏天晴判断金色十字星材质不明、做工精致、手感扎实、不像塑料玩具，应该是魔法少女必备的变身道具。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_guardian_star"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_22",
        "from": 43,
        "to": 45,
        "text": "苏天晴思考每日任务要怎么查看，是否像前世网络小说一样默念系统，或者有特别解锁密码。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_daily_task"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_23",
        "from": 46,
        "to": 46,
        "text": "相较于莫名其妙的秘典，苏天晴对守护之星更感兴趣，眼中放出光彩。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_guardian_star",
          "r_ancient_book"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_24",
        "from": 47,
        "to": 47,
        "text": "苏天晴想到魔法少女变身、穿华丽洋装在城市间穿梭飞行与怪人战斗，这具身体的原主人也曾经梦想过这种场面。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_su_original",
          "r_villain_role"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_25",
        "from": 48,
        "to": 48,
        "text": "苏天晴自问要不要试试看。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_guardian_star"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_26",
        "from": 50,
        "to": 50,
        "text": "狐狐试探性喊出变身。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "request",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_guardian_star"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_27",
        "from": 52,
        "to": 52,
        "text": "苏天晴疑问变身不是这么喊，或要加前缀。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d_28",
        "from": 53,
        "to": 56,
        "text": "狐狐先后喊出魔法少女变身、henshin、光啊、盖亚。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d_29",
        "from": 57,
        "to": 57,
        "text": "狐狐嗓子快喊哑，把能想到的变身词全喊了一遍，十字星仍无动静。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_fox_body",
          "r_guardian_star"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_30",
        "from": 58,
        "to": 58,
        "text": "苏天晴抱怨秘典不给新手指引，别人拿到系统有新手任务，至少该教怎么变身。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_ancient_book",
          "r_daily_task"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_31",
        "from": 59,
        "to": 59,
        "text": "苏天晴觉得破玩意没意思。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su_current",
        "about": [
          "r_guardian_star"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_32",
        "from": 60,
        "to": 63,
        "text": "狐狐瘫在沙发上端详十字星，找不到写字，尝试敲或搓，最后苏天晴将拇指摁进十字星中央凹陷。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_fox_body",
          "r_su_current",
          "r_guardian_star"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d_33",
        "from": 64,
        "to": 65,
